<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Discovering Divergent Representations between Text-to-Image Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Experimental Details</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Discovering Divergent Representations between Text-to-Image Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Limitations and Failure Cases</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Discovering Divergent Representations between Text-to-Image Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Additional Discussion</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS1" title="In Appendix G Additional Discussion ‣ Discovering Divergent Representations between Text-to-Image Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.1 </span>Advantages of the Pairwise setting over Single Model Auditing</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A7.SS2" title="In Appendix G Additional Discussion ‣ Discovering Divergent Representations between Text-to-Image Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G.2 </span>Extending CompCon to a multi model setup</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
